        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Flashrain\" data-post=\"1\" data-topic=\"483347\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://sea1.discourse-cdn.com/eveonline/user_avatar/forums.eveonline.com/flashrain/48/457569_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Flashrain:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>MCP would operate on a separate server layer, tracking individualized player behavior and feeding context into existing systems.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>CCP couldn’t even get the Activity Tracker to work properly, so they just removed it, and you expect them to make something like this work?</p>",
